<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>8품사의 지도 — 단어를 일하는 방식으로 나누다</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Black+Han+Sans&family=IBM+Plex+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --paper:#FAF7F0;--card:#FFFFFF;--ink:#23272F;--sub:#727784;--line:#E7E2D6;
  --root:#1F3A5F;--root-bg:#E8EEF6;
  --b:#B8860B;--b-bg:#FEF8E1;
  --c:#1E7A5A;--c-bg:#E2F3EB;
  --d:#C84F2F;--d-bg:#FBE8E0;
  --e:#5D4FA3;--e-bg:#EBE7F8;
  --hl:#FFE45C;--ok:#1E7A5A;--bad:#C0392B;--r:14px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
body{font-family:'IBM Plex Sans KR',sans-serif;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.65;
  background-image:radial-gradient(#e9e4d6 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:26px 26px;}
.wrap{max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 90px}
header{padding:38px 0 10px;text-align:center}
.eyebrow{display:inline-block;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--root);
  border:1.5px solid var(--root);border-radius:999px;padding:3px 14px;margin-bottom:14px;background:#fff}
h1{font-family:'Black Han Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.9rem,6vw,2.7rem);line-height:1.25;font-weight:400}
h1 .mark{background:linear-gradient(transparent 58%,var(--hl) 58%);padding:0 4px}
.tagline{color:var(--sub);margin-top:10px;font-size:.95rem}
.stepper{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(250,247,240,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin:22px -16px 0;padding:10px 8px}
.steps{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:3px;max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;flex-wrap:wrap}
.step{flex:1;max-width:96px;min-width:62px;border:none;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3px;padding:6px 2px;border-radius:10px}
.step .dot{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:.95rem;background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--line);transition:.25s}
.step .lb{font-size:.66rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--sub);white-space:nowrap}
.step.cur .dot{border-color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(35,39,47,.12)}
.step.cur .lb{color:var(--ink)}
.step.done .dot{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:#fff}
.step.locked{opacity:.42;cursor:not-allowed}
.step:not(.locked):hover .dot{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.stage{display:none;animation:fadeUp .4s ease}
.stage.show{display:block}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.path{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin:26px 0 8px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700}
.path .crumb{padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--line)}
.path .crumb.on-root{border-color:var(--root);color:var(--root);background:var(--root-bg)}
.path .crumb.on-b{border-color:var(--b);color:var(--b);background:var(--b-bg)}
.path .crumb.on-c{border-color:var(--c);color:var(--c);background:var(--c-bg)}
.path .crumb.on-d{border-color:var(--d);color:var(--d);background:var(--d-bg)}
.path .crumb.on-e{border-color:var(--e);color:var(--e);background:var(--e-bg)}
.path .sep{color:var(--sub)}
h2.stitle{font-family:'Black Han Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:1.55rem;margin:4px 0 4px}
.ssub{color:var(--sub);font-size:.93rem;margin-bottom:18px}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:20px 22px;margin:14px 0;
  box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(40,35,20,.05)}
.card h3{font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.card h3 .chip{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:999px}
.chip.c-root{background:var(--root-bg);color:var(--root)}
.chip.c-b{background:var(--b-bg);color:var(--b)}
.chip.c-c{background:var(--c-bg);color:var(--c)}
.chip.c-d{background:var(--d-bg);color:var(--d)}
.chip.c-e{background:var(--e-bg);color:var(--e)}
.card p{margin:6px 0}.card ul{margin:6px 0 6px 20px}
.card table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:8px 0;font-size:.9rem}
.card th,.card td{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px 8px;text-align:center}
.card th{background:#F7F5EE}
.kw{font-weight:700}
.kw.b{color:var(--b)}.kw.c{color:var(--c)}.kw.d{color:var(--d)}.kw.e{color:var(--e)}.kw.root{color:var(--root)}
.test-box{margin-top:12px;border:1.5px dashed var(--ink);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;background:#FFFDF4;font-size:.92rem}
.test-box b{display:block;margin-bottom:2px}
.enline{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.en{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:1.12rem;line-height:1.7}
.hl{padding:1px 3px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:600;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 30%,var(--hl) 30%)}
.hl.b{box-shadow:inset 0 -2.5px 0 var(--b)}.hl.c{box-shadow:inset 0 -2.5px 0 var(--c)}
.hl.d{box-shadow:inset 0 -2.5px 0 var(--d)}.hl.e{box-shadow:inset 0 -2.5px 0 var(--e)}
.hl.root{box-shadow:inset 0 -2.5px 0 var(--root)}
.spk{flex:none;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:999px;width:34px;height:34px;
  cursor:pointer;font-size:.95rem;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:.2s}
.spk:hover{border-color:var(--ink)}
.spk.playing{background:var(--hl);border-color:var(--ink);animation:pulse 1s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{50%{transform:scale(1.12)}}
.exc{border-left:4px solid var(--line);padding:12px 16px;margin:12px 0;background:#fff;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.exc.b{border-left-color:var(--b)}.exc.c{border-left-color:var(--c)}
.exc.d{border-left-color:var(--d)}.exc.e{border-left-color:var(--e)}.exc.root{border-left-color:var(--root)}
.tgl{margin-top:8px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:4px 12px;
  font-family:inherit;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:var(--sub)}
.tgl:hover{border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--ink)}
.tgl[aria-expanded="true"]{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ink)}
.trans{display:none;margin-top:9px;font-size:.9rem;background:#F7F5EE;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px}
.trans.open{display:block}
.trans .ko{font-weight:600}.trans .note{color:var(--sub);font-size:.85rem;margin-top:3px}
.tree{padding:6px 0 6px 4px}
.tree ul{list-style:none;padding-left:26px;position:relative}
.tree>ul{padding-left:0}
.tree ul ul::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:8px;top:-8px;bottom:14px;border-left:2px solid var(--line)}
.tree li{position:relative;padding:5px 0}
.tree ul ul li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-18px;top:21px;width:16px;border-top:2px solid var(--line)}
.node{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;background:#fff;border:1.8px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:10px;padding:5px 12px;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;cursor:pointer;transition:.18s;font-family:inherit}
.node .e{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;color:var(--sub);font-size:.82rem}
.node:hover{transform:translateX(2px)}
.node.nd-root{border-color:var(--root);background:var(--root-bg)}
.node.nd-b{border-color:var(--b);background:var(--b-bg)}
.node.nd-c{border-color:var(--c);background:var(--c-bg)}
.node.nd-d{border-color:var(--d);background:var(--d-bg)}
.node.nd-e{border-color:var(--e);background:var(--e-bg)}
.node.leaf{border-style:dashed;font-family:'Lora',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:600}
.qz{background:var(--card);border:1.5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:var(--r);padding:20px 22px;margin:26px 0;
  box-shadow:4px 4px 0 rgba(35,39,47,.9)}
.qz-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px}
.qz-head .badge{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;padding:3px 11px;border-radius:999px}
.q{margin:18px 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line)}
.q:first-of-type{border-top:none}
.qno{font-weight:700;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--sub);margin-bottom:4px}
.qtext{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px}
.qsent{margin:8px 0 12px;padding:10px 14px;background:#F7F5EE;border-radius:10px}
.opts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.opt{text-align:left;font-family:inherit;font-size:.92rem;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:10px;padding:9px 13px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;line-height:1.55}
.opt:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:var(--ink)}
.opt.sel{border-color:var(--ink);background:#F2F0E8;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink)}
.opt.right{border-color:var(--ok);background:var(--c-bg);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ok)}
.opt.wrong{border-color:var(--bad);background:#FBE5E1;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--bad);animation:shake .3s}
.opt:disabled{cursor:default}
@keyframes shake{25%{transform:translateX(-4px)}75%{transform:translateX(4px)}}
.fb{display:none;margin-top:9px;font-size:.87rem;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px}
.fb.show{display:block}
.fb.good{background:var(--c-bg);border:1px solid var(--ok)}
.fb.badf{background:#FBE5E1;border:1px solid var(--bad)}
.selrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:9px 0;padding:9px 12px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}
.selrow select{font-family:inherit;font-size:.88rem;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:#fff}
.selrow .mark{font-weight:700;min-width:22px;text-align:center}
.walkstep{margin:12px 0;padding:11px 13px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:#fff}
.walkstep .wp{font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:8px}
.walkstep.lockedw{opacity:.45;pointer-events:none}
.btn{font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;border:none;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 26px;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s}
.btn.primary{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 rgba(35,39,47,.35)}
.btn.primary:hover{transform:translate(-1px,-1px);box-shadow:4px 4px 0 rgba(35,39,47,.35)}
.btn.primary:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none;box-shadow:none}
.btn.ghost{background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);color:var(--ink)}
.navrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin:28px 0 10px;gap:10px}
.unlock-banner{display:none;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:16px;background:var(--c-bg);border:1.5px solid var(--ok);
  border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;font-weight:600;animation:fadeUp .4s ease}
.unlock-banner.show{display:flex}
.score-wrap{text-align:center;padding:10px 0 4px}
.score-big{font-family:'Black Han Sans',sans-serif;font-size:3.2rem;line-height:1.1}
.grade{font-weight:700;margin-top:2px}
.branchbars{margin:18px 0 6px;text-align:left}
.bb{margin:10px 0}
.bb .bl{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.83rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px}
.bb .track{height:12px;background:#EFEBDF;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}
.bb .fill{height:100%;border-radius:99px;width:0;transition:width .8s ease}
footer{text-align:center;color:var(--sub);font-size:.78rem;margin-top:46px}
@media(max-width:520px){.card,.qz{padding:16px 14px}.step .lb{font-size:.58rem}.en{font-size:1.02rem}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<header>
  <div class="eyebrow">ENGLISH GRAMMAR · 8 PARTS OF SPEECH</div>
  <h1>8품사의 <span class="mark">지도</span>를 그리다</h1>
  <p class="tagline">단어를 '문장에서 하는 일'로 8갈래로 나눕니다. 처음 배우지만, 원리로 이해하면 외울 게 없습니다.<br>🔊 버튼으로 모든 영어 표현을 들어보세요.</p>
</header>
<nav class="stepper"><div class="steps" id="steps"></div></nav>
<main id="main"></main>
<footer>8품사의 지도 · 고1 영문법 입문 · Web Speech API 듣기 지원</footer>
</div>
<script>
/* ===== DATA ===== */
const TREE={k:'8품사',e:'Eight Parts of Speech',c:'root',kids:[
  {k:'명사',e:'Noun',c:'b',kids:[
    {leaf:'보통·집합·고유·물질·추상',say:'common collective proper material abstract noun'},
    {leaf:'가산 / 불가산',say:'countable and uncountable nouns'},
    {leaf:'복수형 (규칙·불규칙)',say:'plural forms'},
    {leaf:'역할: 주어·목적어·보어',say:'subject object complement'}
  ]},
  {k:'대명사',e:'Pronoun',c:'b',kids:[
    {leaf:'인칭 (주격·소유격·목적격·소유대명사·재귀)',say:'personal pronoun'},
    {leaf:'지시 (this/that/these/those)',say:'demonstrative pronoun'},
    {leaf:'부정 (some/any/one/each/all)',say:'indefinite pronoun'},
    {leaf:'의문 (who/what/which)',say:'interrogative pronoun'}
  ]},
  {k:'동사',e:'Verb',c:'d',kids:[
    {leaf:'be동사 / 일반동사 / 조동사',say:'be verb, general verb, auxiliary verb'},
    {leaf:'자동사 / 타동사',say:'intransitive and transitive verbs'},
    {leaf:'동작·상태를 나타냄',say:'action and state'}
  ]},
  {k:'형용사',e:'Adjective',c:'c',kids:[
    {leaf:'한정적(명사 앞) / 서술적(보어)',say:'attributive and predicative'},
    {leaf:'수량형용사 (many/much/few/little)',say:'quantity adjectives'}
  ]},
  {k:'부사',e:'Adverb',c:'c',kids:[
    {leaf:'동사·형용사·부사·문장 수식',say:'adverb modifies verb adjective adverb sentence'},
    {leaf:'형용사+ly / 동형(fast,hard,early)',say:'adjective plus ly'},
    {leaf:'빈도부사 위치',say:'frequency adverb position'}
  ]},
  {k:'전치사',e:'Preposition',c:'e',kids:[
    {leaf:'시간 at/on/in',say:'at on in for time'},
    {leaf:'장소·방향 at/on/in/to',say:'place and direction'},
    {leaf:'뒤의 대명사는 목적격',say:'object of a preposition'}
  ]},
  {k:'접속사',e:'Conjunction',c:'e',kids:[
    {leaf:'등위 (and/but/or/so)',say:'coordinating conjunction'},
    {leaf:'종속 (when/because/if/that)',say:'subordinating conjunction'},
    {leaf:'상관 (both A and B, either/or)',say:'correlative conjunction'}
  ]},
  {k:'감탄사',e:'Interjection',c:'b',kids:[
    {leaf:'감정 표현 (Oh! Wow! Oops!)',say:'interjection'},
    {leaf:'문장과 독립적',say:'independent of the sentence'}
  ]}
]};

const STAGES=[
/* ── 0 큰 그림 ── */
{id:'map',icon:'🗺️',label:'큰 그림',pathArr:[['8품사','root']],
 title:'1단계 · 큰 그림 — 단어를 8가지 일꾼으로 나누다',
 sub:'8품사는 단어를 "문장에서 하는 일(기능)"에 따라 나눈 8개의 갈래입니다. 단어에 품사가 박혀 있는 게 아니라, 문장 속 역할이 품사를 정합니다.',
 cards:[
  {t:'h',chip:['지도','root'],title:'품사란 무엇인가 — 글자가 아니라 "역할"',html:
   `<p>품사는 단어를 <b>문장에서 하는 일</b>로 분류한 것입니다. 그래서 <b>같은 단어도 역할이 바뀌면 품사가 달라집니다.</b></p>
    <ul><li><i>the <b>water</b></i> (그 물) → <span class="kw b">명사</span> / <i>I <b>water</b> the plants.</i> (물을 주다) → <span class="kw d">동사</span></li>
        <li><i>a <b>fast</b> car</i> (빠른 차) → <span class="kw c">형용사</span> / <i>run <b>fast</b></i> (빨리 달리다) → <span class="kw c">부사</span></li></ul>
    <div class="test-box"><b>🔑 핵심 원리</b>품사를 알면 문장의 뼈대(주어·동사·목적어)가 보입니다. "이 단어가 지금 무슨 일을 하지?"를 묻는 것이 8품사 학습의 전부입니다.</div>`},
  {t:'h',chip:['목록','root'],title:'8품사 한눈에',html:
   `<table><tr><th>품사</th><th>하는 일</th><th>예</th></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="kw b">명사</span></td><td>사람·사물·개념의 이름</td><td>book, Tom, water</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="kw b">대명사</span></td><td>명사를 대신함</td><td>I, you, it, this</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="kw d">동사</span></td><td>동작·상태</td><td>run, is, can</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="kw c">형용사</span></td><td>명사를 꾸밈/보어</td><td>happy, three</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="kw c">부사</span></td><td>동사·형용사·부사·문장 꾸밈</td><td>very, slowly</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="kw e">전치사</span></td><td>명사 앞에서 관계를 나타냄</td><td>in, on, with</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="kw e">접속사</span></td><td>말과 말을 연결</td><td>and, but, because</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="kw b">감탄사</span></td><td>감정을 나타내는 독립어</td><td>Oh!, Wow!</td></tr></table>`},
  {t:'tree'},
 ],
 cp:[
  {q:'8품사는 무엇을 기준으로 단어를 나눈 것인가?',
   opts:['단어의 글자 수','단어가 문장에서 하는 일(기능·역할)','단어의 발음','단어가 어려운 정도'],
   ans:1,ex:'품사는 "기능"으로 나눈 갈래입니다. 그래서 같은 단어도 문장 속 역할에 따라 품사가 달라집니다.'},
  {q:'"I water the flowers."에서 water의 품사는?',
   opts:['명사','동사','형용사','전치사'],
   ans:1,ex:'뒤에 목적어(the flowers)를 두고 "물을 주다"라는 동작을 나타내므로 동사입니다. "the water"처럼 쓰면 명사가 됩니다.'}
 ]},

/* ── 1 명사·대명사 ── */
{id:'noun',icon:'🧱',label:'명사·대명사',pathArr:[['8품사','root'],['명사·대명사','b']],
 title:'2단계 · 명사 & 대명사 — 이름 붙이기와 대신하기',
 sub:'명사는 "이름", 대명사는 "그 이름을 대신하는 말"입니다. 가산/불가산 구별과 인칭대명사의 격이 핵심입니다.',
